Package: kitty-gtk
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libcanberra0, libegl1, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Description: kitty terminal emulator with a GTK 4 / libadwaita backend
 A build of the gtk-backend branch of kitty, a fast, feature-rich, GPU based
 terminal emulator, with a GLFW backend that uses GTK 4 and libadwaita on
 Wayland. It is installed in /opt/kitty-gtk and can be installed alongside
 the kitty package. Run it with kitty-gtk.
